  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Olympia, WA\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Olympia, WA\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nOlympia, WA\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n360.810.8885\n2432 Heritage Ct SW\nOlympia, WA 98502\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nMon-Fri 8 am-5 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Olympia.\nBluePearl is an emergency and specialty pet hospital located in Olympia, north of 101 and west of Capitol Lake.\nWe serve pets and their families in the greater Seattle area, south Puget Sound and much of southwestern Washington, including Tumwater, Lamberts Corner and more.\nOur services.\nWhen you have a pet emergency, seconds count. We want you to know, we’re ready 24/7. If your pet has a condition that requires a specialist’s expertise, we’re ready for that too. Our experienced veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIf your pet is experiencing an emergency, we’re here to help. If possible, please call ahead so we can talk you through your pet’s situation and prepare for your arrival. No appointment is necessary to see our skilled emergency veterinarians.\nWe work closely with your pet’s primary care veterinarian to understand your pet's history and create a comprehensive care plan.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout our pet hospital.\nFormally known as Olympia Veterinary Specialists (OVS), we joined the BluePearl family in 2023 and moved to our upgraded hospital in 2024.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing you with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n360.810.8885\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n360.810.8885\n360.634.8231\n2432 Heritage Ct SW\nOlympia,\nWA                                    98502\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nTacoma\nLakewood, WA\n2510 84th St. S, Ste. 30D\nLakewood, WA 98499\n253.474.0791\n23.71 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nTukwila, WA\n402 Baker Blvd.\nTukwila, WA 98188\n425.496.1000\n43.28 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nKirkland, WA\n11814 115th Ave. NE, Bldg. J\nKirkland, WA 98034\n425.823.9111\n58.17 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
